======================================================================
AnchorCCTP CLI Functional Evidence Log (PRD §12 Verification Evidence)
======================================================================

Recorded: 2026-10-02
Packages: @anchor-cctp/cli@1.0.2 + @anchor-cctp/core-sdk@1.0.1 (built from
this repo: `npm run build --workspace=@anchor-cctp/core-sdk` then
`--workspace=@anchor-cctp/cli`; `anchor-cctp --version` reports v1.0.2).
Each section shows the exact command, exit code, stdout, and stderr.
`init` writes into /tmp/opencode/l07/ (not the repo) so no source file is
touched. `verify` §4 hits live Circle Iris sandbox
(https://iris-api-sandbox.circle.com) for a real completed Base Sepolia
burn (the same BURN A recorded in core-receive-sepolia.log §1).

